message: "If you use this repository, please cite it."
title: 'Reification Gradient: Study 1 (behavioral) of "Held but not heeded"'
abstract: >-
  The behavioral study (Study 1) of a three-study preregistered program on whether a
  language model treats an invented psychiatric category as real and fabricates clinical
  structure it was never given. Two open-weight models evaluated 60 Spanish clinical
  vignettes across 4 category conditions and 5 source-legitimacy levels (7,200 runs).
  The representational and causal studies (Studies 2-3) and the manuscript are in the
  sibling repository workspace-program.
